---
import DashboardLayout from "../../../components/dashboard/DashboardLayout.astro";
import OnboardingStepper from "../../../components/onboarding/OnboardingStepper.jsx";
---

<DashboardLayout title="Market Education" user={null}>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-12">
    <!-- Step Progress Indicator -->
    <OnboardingStepper currentStep={2} client:load />

    <!-- Edit Facilities Link -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <a
        href="/dashboard/onboarding/facilities?step=2&returnTo=/dashboard/contract/market-education"
        class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        Edit Facility Selection
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Strategic Header -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">
        Position Your Center to Win Cash-Pay Volume
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4">
        Our data shows that centers offering 100% Medicare-aligned pricing
        consistently attract more price-sensitive self-pay patients — without
        operational friction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Strategic Benefits -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow border-t-4 border-green-500">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-green-800">
          Market-Based Advantage
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          Patients shop based on affordability and transparency — not exact
          reimbursement schedules. Centers offering pricing aligned with
          Medicare levels are perceived as more reasonable and trustworthy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow border-t-4 border-blue-500">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-blue-800">
          Built-In Operational Fit
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          Most centers already accept 100% Medicare reimbursements for Medicare
          patients. No pricing adjustments needed to participate in the self-pay
          model.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow border-t-4 border-indigo-500">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-indigo-800">
          Priority in Our Referral System
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          USRad's referral platform highlights centers offering Medicare-based
          pricing, giving your facility an edge in visibility and volume.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Strategic Comparison -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        How Pricing Strategy Impacts Patient Volume
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Center A -->
        <div class="bg-green-50 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-600">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-900 mb-3">
            Center A – 100% Medicare Rate
          </h3>
          <ul class="ml-4 text-green-900 space-y-2 list-disc text-sm">
            <li>Featured in USRad’s referral system by default</li>
            <li>Ranked top 3 in searches for cash-pay patients</li>
            <li>Receives 3–5 referrals per week</li>
            <li>No negotiation needed — patients convert quickly</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Center B -->
        <div class="bg-orange-50 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-orange-600">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-orange-900 mb-3">
            Center B – 150% Medicare Rate
          </h3>
          <ul class="ml-4 text-orange-900 space-y-2 list-disc text-sm">
            <li>Shown lower in patient-facing search results</li>
            <li>Receives less than 1 referral per week</li>
            <li>Price-sensitive patients abandon booking</li>
            <li>Volume loss outweighs higher reimbursement</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 text-sm text-gray-600 text-center">
        Centers aligned with patient expectations win market share — even with
        small pricing shifts.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Optional Disclosure -->
    <details class="mt-8 border-t pt-4">
      <summary
        class="text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:underline font-medium"
      >
        See Detailed Pricing Strategy
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-4">
        <p>
          Self-pay patients don’t know the exact Medicare rate — but they know
          what <em>feels</em> affordable. Many associate Medicare-aligned pricing
          with fairness, reasonableness, and transparency — especially compared to
          hospital or out-of-network billing.
        </p>
        <p>
          USRad’s data shows that centers offering 100% Medicare pricing convert
          faster, with fewer objections and less negotiation friction.
        </p>
        <p>
          When patients see clear, consistent pricing that echoes Medicare
          levels, they book with more confidence — and refer others.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Strategy Tip:</strong> Volume gains at 100% Medicare often outweigh
          revenue per scan at 150% Medicare.
        </p>
        <p>
          Want to explore the numbers? <a
            href="/downloads/medicare-cash-pricing-insights.pdf"
            class="text-blue-600 underline">Download our 1-page breakdown</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">
        Ready to Grow Your Cash-Pay Patient Volume?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
        Accepting 100% Medicare rates positions your center as both affordable
        and accessible.
      </p>
      <button
        onclick="
          localStorage.setItem('market_education_completed', 'true');
          window.location.href='/dashboard/contract/terms';
        "
        class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all shadow"
      >
        Continue to Contract Terms
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</DashboardLayout>
